        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion BV-S7, Contemporary Proteus Lever with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Proteus lever is one of Fusion Hardware's newest additions to their Contemporary Brass line. Blending contemporary form with warm oil rubbed bronze and brushed nickel finishes, this design is at home in any contemporary scheme. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion Proteus Lever with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Proteus Lever with Square Rose Fusion BV-S7:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Proteus Lever with Square Rose, Fusion BV-S7",
                "description": "Contemporary Proteus Lever with Square Rose, Fusion BV-S7 - The Proteus lever is one of Fusion Hardware's newest additions to their Contemporary Brass line. Blending contemporary form with warm oil rubbed bronze and brushed nickel finishes, this design is at home in any contemporary scheme. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n",
